<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s200S">Because you have <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w1">lied</span>, you live in a world where, when you undertake <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w2">farming</span> or some work in cooperation with other people, in the end the work <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s200p1">fails to prosper</span>, and the people ca<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s200g1">n&#x27;t</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s200p2">work well together</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w3">for the most part</span> everyone is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w4">cheating</span> one another, and is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w5">afraid</span>, and where there are <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s200w6">many</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s200p3">things to be afraid of</span>.</span>
