<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first independent proposal. gru spyod pa is omitted: the ship/navigation vocabulary does not establish a lexical equivalence to work in cooperation with other people. las kyi mtha' and its several English work/end exponents are distributed and omitted. rgyas par mi 'gyur ba is a complete phrase fails to prosper. mthun par owns work well together at phrase depth; the following mi owns only n't in can't, leaving the auxiliary ca unwrapped. The residual 'gyur is omitted as part of the recast rather than given a false absence null. The fear-causes expression is kept as a phrase things to be afraid of, with many separately aligned. Supplied participants and existential framing remain unwrapped.</div>
